{"schema_version":"talkami_spoken_audio_manifest_v2","theme_id":"03.01","status":"audio_not_recorded","main_count":116,"reply_count":27,"alternative_count":19,"total_audio_count":162,"audio_naming":"${id}.mp3","entries":[{"id":"03.01.01-S001","kind":"main","cn":"你平时几点起床？","meaning_my":"ပုံမှန် မနက် ဘယ်နှနာရီ အိပ်ရာထလဲ။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"一般七点左右。","meaning_my":"ပုံမှန် မနက် ခုနစ်နာရီလောက်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S001_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"平时几点起？","meaning_my":"ပုံမှန် ဘယ်နှနာရီထလဲ။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S001_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S002","kind":"main","cn":"我七点起床。","meaning_my":"မနက် ခုနစ်နာရီမှာ အိပ်ရာထတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S003","kind":"main","cn":"明早几点起？","meaning_my":"မနက်ဖြန် မနက် ဘယ်နှနာရီထမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"六点，得早点出门。","meaning_my":"မနက် ခြောက်နာရီ၊ စောစောထွက်ရမှာ။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S004","kind":"main","cn":"明天我要早起。","meaning_my":"မနက်ဖြန် စောစောထရမယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S005","kind":"main","cn":"该起床了。","meaning_my":"အိပ်ရာထချိန် ရောက်ပြီ။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S006","kind":"main","cn":"再睡五分钟。","meaning_my":"နောက်ထပ် ငါးမိနစ်လောက် အိပ်ဦးမယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S007","kind":"main","cn":"我起不来。","meaning_my":"အိပ်ရာက မထနိုင်ဘူး။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S008","kind":"main","cn":"我刚起床。","meaning_my":"အခုမှ အိပ်ရာထတာ။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S009","kind":"main","cn":"我睡过头了。","meaning_my":"အိပ်ရာထ နောက်ကျသွားတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S009_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"那快点，要迟到了。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို မြန်မြန်လုပ်၊ နောက်ကျတော့မယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S009_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S009_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我起晚了。","meaning_my":"အိပ်ရာထ နောက်ကျသွားတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S009_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S010","kind":"main","cn":"闹钟没响。","meaning_my":"နှိုးစက် မမြည်ဘူး။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S011","kind":"main","cn":"我忘了设闹钟。","meaning_my":"နှိုးစက်ချိန်ဖို့ မေ့သွားတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S012","kind":"main","cn":"明早记得叫我。","meaning_my":"မနက်ဖြန်မနက် နှိုးပေးဖို့ မမေ့နဲ့နော်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S012_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，七点叫你。","meaning_my":"အင်း၊ မနက် ခုနစ်နာရီ နှိုးပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S012_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S013","kind":"main","cn":"闹钟响了吗？","meaning_my":"နှိုးစက် မြည်ပြီလား။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S014","kind":"main","cn":"你几点睡？","meaning_my":"ည ဘယ်နှနာရီမှာ အိပ်လဲ။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S014_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"一般十一点左右。","meaning_my":"ပုံမှန် ည ဆယ့်တစ်နာရီလောက်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S014_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S015","kind":"main","cn":"我一般十一点左右睡。","meaning_my":"ပုံမှန် ည ဆယ့်တစ်နာရီလောက် အိပ်တယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S016","kind":"main","cn":"你昨晚几点睡的？","meaning_my":"မနေ့ညက ဘယ်နှနာရီလောက် အိပ်တာလဲ။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S016_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"差不多十二点。","meaning_my":"ည ဆယ့်နှစ်နာရီလောက်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S016_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S017","kind":"main","cn":"最近都睡得比较晚。","meaning_my":"ဒီရက်ပိုင်း ညဘက် နောက်ကျမှ အိပ်ဖြစ်တယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S018","kind":"main","cn":"周末我一般起得晚。","meaning_my":"ပိတ်ရက်ဆို ပုံမှန်ထက် နောက်ကျမှ အိပ်ရာထတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S019","kind":"main","cn":"昨晚没睡好。","meaning_my":"မနေ့ညက ကောင်းကောင်း မအိပ်ရဘူး။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S019_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"怎么了，睡不着吗？","meaning_my":"ဘာဖြစ်လို့လဲ၊ အိပ်မပျော်ဘူးလား။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S019_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S019_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"昨晚没怎么睡好。","meaning_my":"မနေ့ညက ကောင်းကောင်း မအိပ်ရဘူး။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S019_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S020","kind":"main","cn":"我有点困。","meaning_my":"နည်းနည်း အိပ်ငိုက်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S021","kind":"main","cn":"我今天想早点睡。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ စောစောအိပ်ချင်တယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S022","kind":"main","cn":"我先睡了。","meaning_my":"အရင် အိပ်တော့မယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S022_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我睡啦。","meaning_my":"အိပ်တော့မယ်နော်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S022_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S023","kind":"main","cn":"该睡了。","meaning_my":"အိပ်ချိန်ရောက်ပြီ။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S024","kind":"main","cn":"别睡太晚。","meaning_my":"ည အရမ်းနောက်ကျမှ မအိပ်နဲ့နော်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S025","kind":"main","cn":"我睡不着。","meaning_my":"အိပ်မပျော်ဘူး။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S025_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"先别看手机了。","meaning_my":"ဖုန်း ခဏမကြည့်နဲ့ဦး။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S025_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S025_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"睡不着觉。","meaning_my":"အိပ်မပျော်ဘူး။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S025_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S026","kind":"main","cn":"我作息不太规律。","meaning_my":"အိပ်ချိန်၊ အိပ်ရာထချိန် သိပ်မမှန်ဘူး။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S026.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S027","kind":"main","cn":"我习惯早睡早起。","meaning_my":"ပုံမှန် စောစောအိပ်ပြီး စောစောထတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S027.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S028","kind":"main","cn":"睡前别玩手机。","meaning_my":"မအိပ်ခင် ဖုန်းသိပ်မသုံးနဲ့။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S028.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S029","kind":"main","cn":"睡前记得关灯。","meaning_my":"မအိပ်ခင် မီးပိတ်ဖို့ မမေ့နဲ့။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S029.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S030","kind":"main","cn":"我先关灯了。","meaning_my":"မီး အရင်ပိတ်လိုက်မယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S030.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S031","kind":"main","cn":"我午睡了一会儿。","meaning_my":"နေ့လယ် ခဏအိပ်လိုက်တယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S031.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.01-S032","kind":"main","cn":"我一躺下就睡着了。","meaning_my":"လှဲလိုက်တာနဲ့ အိပ်ပျော်သွားတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.01-S032.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S001","kind":"main","cn":"我去洗澡。","meaning_my":"ရေချိုးသွားဦးမယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S001_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我去冲个澡。","meaning_my":"ရေချိုးလိုက်ဦးမယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S001_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S002","kind":"main","cn":"洗完了吗？我也要用。","meaning_my":"ရေချိုးပြီးပြီလား၊ ဆက်သုံးချင်လို့။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S002_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"快了，再等五分钟。","meaning_my":"ပြီးတော့မယ်၊ နောက်ထပ် ငါးမိနစ်လောက် စောင့်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S002_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S003","kind":"main","cn":"卫生间有人吗？","meaning_my":"အိမ်သာထဲ လူရှိလား။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"有人，稍等一下。","meaning_my":"ရှိတယ်၊ ခဏစောင့်ဦး။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S004","kind":"main","cn":"里面有人。","meaning_my":"အထဲမှာ လူရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S005","kind":"main","cn":"我去刷牙洗脸。","meaning_my":"သွားတိုက်ပြီး မျက်နှာသစ်ဦးမယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S006","kind":"main","cn":"我先去洗把脸。","meaning_my":"မျက်နှာ အရင်သစ်ဦးမယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S007","kind":"main","cn":"牙刷在哪儿？","meaning_my":"သွားတိုက်တံ ဘယ်မှာလဲ။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S007_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"在洗手台上。","meaning_my":"လက်ဆေးဘေစင်ပေါ်မှာ။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S007_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S008","kind":"main","cn":"牙膏没了。","meaning_my":"သွားတိုက်ဆေး ကုန်သွားပြီ။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S008_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"牙膏用完了。","meaning_my":"သွားတိုက်ဆေး ကုန်သွားပြီ။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S008_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S009","kind":"main","cn":"毛巾在哪儿？","meaning_my":"မျက်နှာသုတ်ပဝါ ဘယ်မှာလဲ။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S010","kind":"main","cn":"能帮我拿条毛巾吗？","meaning_my":"မျက်နှာသုတ်ပဝါ တစ်ထည်လောက် ယူပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S011","kind":"main","cn":"洗发水放哪儿了？","meaning_my":"ခေါင်းလျှော်ရည် ဘယ်မှာထားလဲ။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S012","kind":"main","cn":"洗发水快用完了。","meaning_my":"ခေါင်းလျှော်ရည် ကုန်တော့မယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S013","kind":"main","cn":"肥皂在哪儿？","meaning_my":"ဆပ်ပြာ ဘယ်မှာလဲ။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S014","kind":"main","cn":"我先洗个头。","meaning_my":"အရင် ခေါင်းလျှော်ဦးမယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S015","kind":"main","cn":"我忘带毛巾了。","meaning_my":"မျက်နှာသုတ်ပဝါ ယူဖို့ မေ့သွားတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S016","kind":"main","cn":"有热水吗？","meaning_my":"ရေနွေး ရလား။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S016_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"有，但要等一会儿。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ ဒါပေမဲ့ ခဏစောင့်ရမယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S016_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S017","kind":"main","cn":"热水怎么开？","meaning_my":"ရေနွေး ဘယ်လိုဖွင့်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S017_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"往红色那边转。","meaning_my":"အနီရောင်ဘက်ကို လှည့်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S017_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S017_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"怎么开热水？","meaning_my":"ရေနွေး ဘယ်လိုဖွင့်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S017_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S018","kind":"main","cn":"热水器刚打开，还得等一会儿。","meaning_my":"ရေပူစက် အခုမှ ဖွင့်ထားတာ၊ ခဏစောင့်ရဦးမယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S019","kind":"main","cn":"热水要等多久？","meaning_my":"ရေနွေးရဖို့ ဘယ်လောက်စောင့်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S019_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"再等两分钟。","meaning_my":"နောက်ထပ် နှစ်မိနစ်လောက် စောင့်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S019_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S020","kind":"main","cn":"水太凉了。","meaning_my":"ရေ အရမ်းအေးနေတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S021","kind":"main","cn":"水温怎么调？","meaning_my":"ရေအပူချိန် ဘယ်လိုချိန်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S021_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"往热水那边调一点。","meaning_my":"ရေနွေးဘက်ကို နည်းနည်း လှည့်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S021_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S022","kind":"main","cn":"往热水那边调一点。","meaning_my":"ရေနွေးဘက်ကို နည်းနည်း လှည့်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S023","kind":"main","cn":"慢慢调，先试试水温。","meaning_my":"ဖြည်းဖြည်းချိန်၊ ရေအပူချိန်ကို အရင်စမ်းကြည့်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S024","kind":"main","cn":"热水还没出来。","meaning_my":"ရေနွေး မလာသေးဘူး။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S025","kind":"main","cn":"洗完记得关水龙头。","meaning_my":"ရေချိုးပြီးရင် ရေဘုံဘိုင်ပိတ်ဖို့ မမေ့နဲ့နော်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S026","kind":"main","cn":"水太小了。","meaning_my":"ရေထွက်အား နည်းလွန်းတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S026.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S026_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"出水太小了。","meaning_my":"ရေထွက်အား နည်းလွန်းတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S026_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S027","kind":"main","cn":"下水道堵了。","meaning_my":"ရေဆင်းပိုက် ပိတ်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S027.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S027_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"先别放水了。","meaning_my":"ရေ မဖွင့်နဲ့ဦး။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S027_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S027_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"排水管堵了。","meaning_my":"ရေဆင်းပိုက် ပိတ်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S027_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S028","kind":"main","cn":"热水器坏了。","meaning_my":"ရေပူစက် ပျက်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S028.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S029","kind":"main","cn":"有吹风机吗？","meaning_my":"ဆံပင်အခြောက်ခံစက် ရှိလား။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S029.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S029_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"有，在柜子里。","meaning_my":"ရှိတယ်၊ ဗီရိုထဲမှာ။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S029_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.02-S030","kind":"main","cn":"我先洗，你等一下。","meaning_my":"အရင် ရေချိုးလိုက်မယ်၊ ခဏစောင့်ဦးနော်။","audio_file":"03.01.02-S030.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S001","kind":"main","cn":"今天天气怎么样？","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ ရာသီဥတု ဘယ်လိုလဲ။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"有点热，下午可能下雨。","meaning_my":"နည်းနည်းပူတယ်၊ မွန်းလွဲပိုင်း မိုးရွာနိုင်တယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S002","kind":"main","cn":"今天怎么这么热？","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ ဘာလို့ ဒီလောက်ပူတာလဲ။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S003","kind":"main","cn":"外面很热。","meaning_my":"အပြင်မှာ အရမ်းပူတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S004","kind":"main","cn":"真冷啊。","meaning_my":"အေးလိုက်တာ။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S004_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"好冷啊。","meaning_my":"အေးလိုက်တာ။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S004_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S005","kind":"main","cn":"外面有点凉。","meaning_my":"အပြင်မှာ နည်းနည်းချမ်းတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S006","kind":"main","cn":"今天比昨天冷。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ မနေ့ကထက် ပိုအေးတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S007","kind":"main","cn":"今天降温了。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ အပူချိန် ကျသွားတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S008","kind":"main","cn":"今天好闷。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ ပူအိုက်လိုက်တာ။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S008_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"今天太闷热了。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ ပူအိုက်လွန်းတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S008_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S009","kind":"main","cn":"下雨了。","meaning_my":"မိုးရွာနေပြီ။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S009_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"快把衣服收进来。","meaning_my":"အဝတ်တွေ အမြန် အထဲသိမ်းလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S009_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S010","kind":"main","cn":"雨大不大？","meaning_my":"မိုးသည်းလား။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S010_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"挺大的，等小点再走。","meaning_my":"မိုးတော်တော်သည်းတယ်၊ နည်းနည်းစဲမှ သွားရအောင်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S010_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S011","kind":"main","cn":"雨下大了。","meaning_my":"မိုး ပိုသည်းလာပြီ။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S012","kind":"main","cn":"雨停了。","meaning_my":"မိုးတိတ်သွားပြီ။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S012_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"不下雨了。","meaning_my":"မိုးမရွာတော့ဘူး။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S012_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S013","kind":"main","cn":"看样子要下雨。","meaning_my":"မိုးရွာတော့မယ့် ပုံပဲ။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S013_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"好像要下雨了。","meaning_my":"မိုးရွာတော့မယ့်ပုံပဲ။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S013_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S014","kind":"main","cn":"下午可能有雨。","meaning_my":"မွန်းလွဲပိုင်း မိုးရွာနိုင်တယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S015","kind":"main","cn":"明天会下雨吗？","meaning_my":"မနက်ဖြန် မိုးရွာမလား။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S016","kind":"main","cn":"明天天气怎么样？","meaning_my":"မနက်ဖြန် ရာသီဥတု ဘယ်လိုလဲ။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S016_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"听说明天会降温。","meaning_my":"မနက်ဖြန် ပိုအေးမယ်လို့ ကြားတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S016_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S017","kind":"main","cn":"带伞吧。","meaning_my":"ထီးယူသွားနော်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S018","kind":"main","cn":"今天阴天。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ မိုးအုံ့နေတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S019","kind":"main","cn":"天晴了。","meaning_my":"နေပြန်သာလာပြီ။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S020","kind":"main","cn":"风有点大。","meaning_my":"လေ နည်းနည်းပြင်းတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S021","kind":"main","cn":"今天太阳真大。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ နေ အရမ်းပြင်းတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S022","kind":"main","cn":"穿厚一点。","meaning_my":"အဝတ်ထူထူ ဝတ်ထားနော်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S022_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"多穿点。","meaning_my":"အဝတ် နည်းနည်းပိုဝတ်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S022_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S023","kind":"main","cn":"要带外套吗？","meaning_my":"အပေါ်အင်္ကျီ ယူသွားရမလား။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S023_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"带上吧，晚上会冷。","meaning_my":"ယူသွားနော်၊ ညဘက် အေးလိမ့်မယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S023_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S024","kind":"main","cn":"出门记得带外套。","meaning_my":"အပြင်ထွက်ရင် အပေါ်အင်္ကျီ ယူသွားနော်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S025","kind":"main","cn":"不用穿太厚。","meaning_my":"အဝတ် အရမ်းထူထူ ဝတ်စရာမလိုဘူး။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S026","kind":"main","cn":"我穿少了。","meaning_my":"အဝတ်ပါးပါးပဲ ဝတ်လာမိတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S026.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S027","kind":"main","cn":"我穿多了。","meaning_my":"အဝတ်ထူထူ ဝတ်လာမိတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S027.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S028","kind":"main","cn":"早晚温差大。","meaning_my":"မနက်နဲ့ ည အပူအအေး တော်တော်ကွာတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S028.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S029","kind":"main","cn":"你穿这件挺好看。","meaning_my":"ဒီအင်္ကျီနဲ့ တော်တော်လိုက်တယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S029.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S030","kind":"main","cn":"换件薄一点的。","meaning_my":"ပိုပါးတဲ့အင်္ကျီ တစ်ထည် လဲဝတ်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S030.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.03-S031","kind":"main","cn":"天气预报说会下雨。","meaning_my":"မိုးလေဝသခန့်မှန်းချက်မှာ မိုးရွာမယ်လို့ ပြောထားတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.03-S031.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.04-S001","kind":"main","cn":"我有点累。","meaning_my":"နည်းနည်း ပင်ပန်းနေတယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.04-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.04-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"那先休息一下。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို အရင် ခဏနားလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.01.04-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.04-S002","kind":"main","cn":"我休息一下。","meaning_my":"ခဏနားဦးမယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.04-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.04-S002_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我歇一会儿。","meaning_my":"ခဏနားဦးမယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.04-S002_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.04-S003","kind":"main","cn":"歇一会儿吧。","meaning_my":"ခဏနားလိုက်ပါဦး။","audio_file":"03.01.04-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.04-S003_alt01",