.04-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.04-S022","kind":"main","cn":"你先坐着，我来吧。","meaning_my":"အရင် ထိုင်နားပါဦး၊ ဒီဟာတော့ လုပ်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"03.01.04-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.01.04-S023","kind":"main","cn":"你该休息了。","meaning_my":"နားသင့်ပြီနော်။","audio_file":"03.01.04-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"}]}
